      "source": "The test will await the completion of a <code>Callable</code> so that\n<a href=\"#asyncResult(org.hamcrest.Matcher)\"><code>asyncResult(Matcher)</code></a> or <a href=\"#asyncResult(java.lang.Object)\"><code>asyncResult(Object)</code></a> can be used\nto assert the resulting value.",
      "translation": "该测试将等待 `<code>Callable</code>` 完成，以便可以使用<a href=\"#asyncResult(org.hamcrest.Matcher)\"><code>asyncResult(Matcher)</code></a>或<a href=\"#asyncResult(java.lang.Object)\"><code>asyncResult(Object)</code></a>来断言结果值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method can be used when a controller method returns <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Callable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Callable</code></a>\nor <a href=\"../../../../web/context/request/async/WebAsyncTask.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.request.async\"><code>WebAsyncTask</code></a>. The value matched is the value returned from the\n<code>Callable</code> or the exception raised.",
      "translation": "此方法可用于控制器方法返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Callable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Callable</code></a> 或 <a href=\"../../../../web/context/request/async/WebAsyncTask.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.request.async\"><code>WebAsyncTask</code></a> 的情况。匹配的值是 <code>Callable</code> 返回的值或抛出的异常。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
